      "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
